                    Cables. Secret. Repeated for information to CINCPAC; the Deputy Commander,
                    Military Assistance Command, Thailand; and the Embassy in Saigon. Received at
                    the JCS at 7:40 p.m., November 4, and passed to the Department of State, CIA,
                    and White House.</p>
